  <item>
    <title>Vol. 17 流量焦虑与田园牧歌：百万订阅UP主“120 斤的猪”的真实生活</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67dc3f80dd11f9c8c108692f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67dc3f80dd11f9c8c108692f</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 21 Mar 2025 00:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FicsKJz7XI9Y0-YHRkzVTMleXv0r.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>🌳瓜瓜和小王在大理的小院</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhyByCrPtKyzs7nafdWQo2-_c7Oq.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>🐶金毛王大鹫在装深沉</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhzl5cTrwRFdhyXwTr3gykMur7Kc.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>👧👦瓜瓜和小王还有他们的金杯&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>收听预警</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>🤣有大量哈哈大笑：最后有笑到打嗝的彩蛋。</span></p><span></span><p><span>😋录制时小王一直在吃零食，所以还有呲溜等背景音（抱拳）。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>课代表划重点</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="400">06:40</a> 随手拍的视频一夜间在抖音获得了十万加的浏览量</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="595">09:55</a> 从襁褓时期就开始养成“天生圣体”的搞笑视频UP主 如何面对恶评</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="890">14:50</a> 95 后 UP 主移居大理之后的创作转型 流量焦虑和闲适生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1120">18:40</a> 短视频的流量VS创作的持续性 怎么选</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1205">20:05</a> 在抖音有八十万订阅的UP 主 怎么做商务（置换/白嫖）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1645">27:25</a> B 站的数据对于UP主意味着什么他们如何应对流量焦虑 UP主在真诚表达和保持风格的持续性之间如何平衡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1845">30:45</a> 搞笑 UP主的抽象体质是怎么养成的 如何吸引到了自己的受众 视频是如何爆火的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2120">35:20</a> 视频创作瓶颈是怎么出现的 如何被持续驱动进行创作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a> 大理生活改变了我们——特斯拉换金杯！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2530">42:10</a> 观众不再关注和喜欢时怎么办 要退场么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2680">44:40</a> 八十万抖音订阅的 UP 主不做视频后 要去做什么 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2940">49:00</a> 延迟满足和立即马上现在满足&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3135">52:15</a> 直接拖到这里听三个人笑到打嗝的一段&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>想关注瓜瓜和小王？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>抖音搜索：120斤的猪</span></p><span></span><p><span>B 站搜索：120斤的两头猪</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书搜索：120 斤的两头猪</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>想一起散步？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>添加微信 yiqisanbuqu，加入“一起散步去”听众群。</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
